•The moving party bears the burden of persuading the court to grant the motion for summary judgment

•Initial burden of production for a plaintiff moving for summary judgment is to produce evidence that would permit a reasonable jury to decide in favor of the plaintiff at trial

•The defendant can meet initial burden of production two ways: either presenting evidence disproving the plaintiff’s claim, or showing that the plaintiff lacks evidence to prove the plaintiff’s claim

